        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Debbi Fields, Michael Rose\n- Companies: Mrs. Fields Bakeries, Holiday Inn, InterContinental Hotels Group, MGM, Harrah's\n- Places: Nashville, Tennessee; Atlanta, Georgia\n- Roles: founder, spokesperson, CEO\n- Topics: hotel brands, acquisitions\n\nFacts:\n- Debbi Fields was born on September 18, 1956.\n- Debbi Fields is the founder and spokesperson of Mrs. Fields Bakeries.\n- Holiday Inn is an American hotel brand and a subsidiary of InterContinental Hotels Group.\n- Holiday Inn is based in Atlanta, Georgia.\n- Boardwalk Hotel and Casino was part of the Holiday Inn hotel chain until MGM acquired it in 2000.\n- Michael Rose was a former CEO of Holiday Inn and Harrah's.\n- Debbi Fields currently lives in Nashville, Tennessee, with her husband Michael Rose.",
